Just ascended to demi-god hood status with about 6,000,000 points. 3.1 is a
marked improvement on 3.0j, but there are a few things that could do with
fixing IMHO....


You zap a wand of create spoiler  -more-






















Please, please, please, dev team, can you get rid of the random teleport
back down the levels of hell as you're coming up. It adds nothing to the
game and only creates frustration and annoyance. Perhaps compensate by
having the wiz come after you more often.

The ordinairy sack is a greatly undervalued item. As well as saving 
bags of holding from getting cursed, with all the weight & disappearing
item problems that gives, the sack is also a quick & easy way of telling
the real amulet apart from all the cheap plastic imitation ones that the wiz
generates from time to time.

A few spell books, a wand of polymorph and a bit of polypiling rapidly gives
access to all the spells in the game, even for a pretty thick barbarian.

I'd put a helm of opposite alignment on the wish list for neutral characters,
if they haven't already found one. AFAIK the only weapons which guard against
level drain are Excalibur & Stormy, which leaves neutral characters a bit stuck.

